      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historically, Gage Park hosted major employers like Central Steel and Wire Company, Royal Crown Bottling, and World’s Finest Chocolate, thanks to its rail borders.",
